	/// First day of the month as a date: the axis of the monthly charts. A date axis is continuous, so a chart shows every month of the period without a scroll bar; on the text column Jahr-Monat the axis is categorical, needs about 20 px a month and scrolls after about two years. Also the drillthrough field of Erzeugung & Last.
	column Monatsanfang = DATE('Datum'[Jahr], 'Datum'[Monat], 1)
